<web-view
  wx:if="{{ready && !failed}}"
  src="{{url}}"
  bindload="onWebviewLoad"
  binderror="onWebviewError"
  bindmessage="onMessage"
></web-view>

<view wx:elif="{{failed}}" class="card">
  <view class="card-title">网页加载失败</view>
  <view class="muted">{{errorMsg}}</view>
  <view class="muted" style="margin-top:16rpx;">
    常见原因：域名未在小程序后台配置为「业务域名」、证书无效、或 H5 服务未上线。
  </view>
  <button class="btn" bindtap="onRetry">重新加载</button>
  <button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="onGuide">查看配置说明</button>
</view>
